// SRCB_PROT_REFRESH — live-install tail patch for the Spell Revisions — Chriz Balance Patch
// fork (docs/plans/2026-08-22-fork-setup-and-protection-refresh-fix-design.md).
//
// Retrofits an ALREADY-INSTALLED Spell Revisions (EE games, v4.19+) so that Protection from
// Magic Energy / Protection from the Elements / Protection from Energy refresh the RECIPIENT's
// instance instead of stripping the CASTER's. Fresh installs should use the fork's
// spell_rev/lib/refresh_non_stacking.tpa (MAKE_REFRESHING_DIRECT), which produces the same
// end state. Safe to append at the tail of a live WeiDU stack; nothing is uninstalled.

BACKUP ~weidu_external/backup/SRCB_PROT_REFRESH~
AUTHOR ~Chriz (Spell Revisions — Chriz Balance Patch, https://github.com/Chrizhermann/chriz-spell-revisions-patch)~
VERSION ~1.0~

BEGIN ~Fix: Protection from Magic Energy / the Elements / Energy strip the caster's buff instead of refreshing the recipient's~ DESIGNATED 0
LABEL ~SRCB_PROT_REFRESH-prot-refresh-target~
REQUIRE_PREDICATE (GAME_IS ~bgee bg2ee eet iwdee~) ~This patch targets the Enhanced Edition engine (Spell Revisions only adds the refresh effect there).~
REQUIRE_PREDICATE (MOD_IS_INSTALLED ~spell_rev/setup-spell_rev.tp2~ 0) ~This patch requires Spell Revisions (main component) to be installed.~

INCLUDE ~SRCB_PROT_REFRESH/lib/prot_refresh_target.tpa~

LAF srcb_fix_protection_refresh END
